OL,3,GNEWSAPolice trial AI chatbot to free up
OL,4,Acall handlers
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaffordshire Police has launched an
OL,7,FAI-powered chatbot to answer
OL,8,Fnon-emergency queries from people, in a
OL,9,Fbid to cut waiting times and free up
OL,10,Fcall handlers for more complex cases.
OL,12,FThe force claimed it was the first in
OL,13,Fthe West Midlands to introduce Bobbi,
OL,14,Fan AI-virtual assistant, available
OL,15,Fthrough the live chat function on its
OL,16,Fwebsite.
OL,18,FCh Supt Matthew Morgan, head of the
OL,19,Fforce's contact centre, said one of the
OL,20,Fmost common questions from the public
OL,21,Fwas whether an incident was a crime.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
